<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" session="false" %>
<%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="jakarta.tags.core" %>
<c:set var="pageTitle" value="User Guide" scope="request"/>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><%@ include file="../common/head.jsp" %><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/css/modules/auth.css"></head>
<body class="drivehub auth-page instructions-page" data-context="${pageContext.request.contextPath}" data-page="instructions">
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>
<%-- FRONTEND MOCK DATA: replace with backend model/JSTL later --%>
<main class="instructions-main" id="main-content"><header class="instructions-hero"><a class="auth-brand" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login"><span class="brand-mark"><i class="bi bi-car-front-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span><strong>DriveHub</strong><small>Vehicle Rental Service</small></span></a><div><h1>Welcome to DriveHub!</h1><p>Follow the steps below to get started based on your account type.</p></div><div class="instructions-vehicle" aria-hidden="true"></div></header><section class="account-types"><h2>Choose Your Account Type</h2><div class="guide-grid"><a class="account-type customer" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/customer/dashboard"><span class="account-icon"><i class="bi bi-person-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><h3>Customer</h3><p>Browse and rent vehicles for your trips.</p></div></a><a class="account-type owner" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/owner/dashboard"><span class="account-icon"><i class="bi bi-car-front-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><h3>Vehicle Owner</h3><p>List and manage your own vehicles and track earnings.</p></div></a><a class="account-type admin" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/dashboard"><span class="account-icon"><i class="bi bi-shield-fill-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><h3>Admin</h3><p>Manage users, vehicles, rentals, payments and more.</p></div></a></div></section><section class="getting-started"><h2>How to Get Started</h2><div class="guide-grid"><article class="guide-column customer"><header><span class="account-icon">1</span><div><h3>Customer</h3><p>Book vehicles easily for your trips</p></div></header><ol><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-person" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register"><strong>1. Create an account</strong></a><p>Register with your details.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login"><strong>2. Login</strong></a><p>Use your email and password.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-car-front" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/customer/vehicles"><strong>3. Browse Vehicles</strong></a><p>Search and filter available vehicles.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-car-front" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/customer/vehicles"><strong>4. Rent a Vehicle</strong></a><p>View details and make a booking.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-credit-card" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/customer/payments"><strong>5. Make Payment</strong></a><p>Complete the payment process.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/customer/rentals"><strong>6. Manage Rentals</strong></a><p>View your upcoming and past rentals.</p></div></li></ol></article><article class="guide-column owner"><header><span class="account-icon">2</span><div><h3>Vehicle Owner</h3><p>List your vehicles and earn</p></div></header><ol><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-person" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register?role=owner"><strong>1. Create an owner account</strong></a><p>Register as a vehicle owner.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login"><strong>2. Login</strong></a><p>Use your credentials.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-car-front" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/owner/vehicles/add"><strong>3. Add Your Vehicles</strong></a><p>Provide vehicle details, photos and pricing.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/owner/vehicles"><strong>4. Manage Vehicle Availability</strong></a><p>Update availability and prices.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-clipboard-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/owner/rental-requests"><strong>5. View Rental Requests</strong></a><p>Accept or manage booking requests.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-wallet2" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/owner/earnings"><strong>6. Track Earnings</strong></a><p>View your rental income and payments.</p></div></li></ol></article><article class="guide-column admin"><header><span class="account-icon">3</span><div><h3>Admin</h3><p>Manage the entire platform</p></div></header><ol><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-person" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login"><strong>1. Login as Admin</strong></a><p>Use your admin credentials.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-people" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/users"><strong>2. Manage Users</strong></a><p>View, add, edit or deactivate users.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-car-front" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/vehicles"><strong>3. Manage Vehicles</strong></a><p>Approve, edit or remove vehicles.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-calendar-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/rentals"><strong>4. Manage Rentals</strong></a><p>Monitor all rental bookings.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-wallet2" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/payments"><strong>5. Manage Payments</strong></a><p>View and verify payments.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><i class="bi bi-buildings" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><a href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/admin/branches"><strong>6. Manage Branches & Reviews</strong></a><p>Handle branches and moderate customer reviews.</p></div></li></ol></article></div></section><section class="help-section" id="help"><h2>Need Help?</h2><p>If you face any issues, contact the DriveHub support team or check the user guide.</p><div class="guide-grid"><a class="account-type customer" href="#main-content"><span class="account-icon"><i class="bi bi-book" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><h3>User Guide</h3><p>Read the complete guide</p></div></a><a class="account-type owner" href="mailto:support@drivehub.com"><span class="account-icon"><i class="bi bi-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><h3>Contact Support</h3><p>support@drivehub.com</p></div></a><a class="account-type admin" href="tel:+94712345678"><span class="account-icon"><i class="bi bi-telephone-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><div><h3>Call Us</h3><p>+94 71 234 5678</p></div></a></div></section><p class="guide-footer"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/login" >Back to Login</a></p></main>
<%@ include file="../common/messages.jsp" %>
</body></html>
